{"id":"vod_jy_32624","vodId":"32624","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"玉子市场","name_cn":"玉子市场","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/221d772de257c968c2c15b9155d436ab.jpg"},"summary":"在一座远离大都会吵闹喧嚣的平凡小镇，不甚兴旺的兔子山商业街内，生活着一群可爱有趣的人。故事的女主角北白川玉子（洲崎绫暂无内容配音）是当地饼店“玉屋”的长女，她性格活泼随和，擅长制作饮食，与对门面饼店“大路屋”的儿子大路饼藏（田丸笃志暂无内容配音）是一对青梅竹马，不过两家的爸爸是典型的同行冤家，彼此一见面便战火不断。这一日，玉子在花店意外发现一只会说话的鸟（山崎巧暂无内容配音）。鸟自称来自南方，肩负着神秘使命。鸟的到来自然为玉子和周边人的生活增添不少乐趣，而快乐浪漫的青春校园生活又令人心驰神往。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-10-17 13:26:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg5oEjb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmwxj3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqjBnyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg5oErb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmwx9Re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqjBk7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axGMrle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJZp9Kd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNxw62a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRgAVVe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY6L9Ad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3l8xAa/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:58:23.534Z"}